  "verse": "Therefore it is not the truth that you can nurture thoughts and feelings at a whim, without you having to give (make) an account for it; therefore you should consider everything if villainous thoughts and feelings proceed from you, such as in relation to killing (murder)… waging battles (waging war), giving false testimony… as well as stinginess and many other things of a wrong sense and negative value.",
